    ("cache-shortcuts-chain", "A resolver can skip the root", "A recursive resolver already has an unexpired delegation and server address for example.test. A new uncached host under that zone can be queried at the known authoritative server without contacting the root; an accepted positive answer can then populate the resolver's cache.", ["root-bootstrap", "referral", "authority-query", "positive-cache"]),
